Subject: [PATCH] BUGFIX fix query information_schema table abort
 issue

Issue:
----------
Query threadpool status from infromation_schema will abort
when threadpool is disabled.

Solution:
----------
Return directly when query threadpool status from infromation_schema
if threadpool is disabled.
